'''Timburr''' (Japanese: '''ドッコラー''' ''Dokkorer'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

