==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Timburr|58}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*'''Corkscrew Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Machop|S2}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 2}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

